    shr_lady "\"I know, darling. I'm a passenger.\""
    show cg shr_epi_lorry onlayer cgl
    "Halfway down, a lorry goes past on the moor road, and the driver sees you, and swerves into the heather and stops, and stares. You wave at him with both hands. Your tits wave too. Your tails fan out behind you like a curtain going up, and you didn't tell them to, and you don't mind."
    shr_you "\"Morning!\""
    "You call it. In your voice. It carries."
    shr_lady "\"Oh, I {i}like{/i} town.\""
    show cg shr_epi_lookback onlayer cgl
    "When you look back from the road, the pillar's on its hillock in the heather, and behind it the red gate, and the two stone foxes on it, watching you go. It'll be there. It'll always be there, for you.\n{size=-5}{color=#ff8fa3}▸ Down into the heather{/color}{/size}"
    jump shr_route_return
